# UX workflow: inspect pattern variation runtime feedback for each supported property.
# Purpose: validates resolved pitch labels and minimal range/delta overlays.

0 scenario seq-variation-pitch
80 capture screen pitch_runtime_feedback

# Editing pitch while runtime telemetry exists must refresh the visual immediately,
# without waiting for the next loop to republish resolved values.
160 encoder MACRO_1 1.00
240 capture screen pitch_runtime_edit_immediate

360 scenario seq-variation-velocity
440 capture screen velocity_runtime_feedback

560 scenario seq-variation-gate
640 capture screen gate_runtime_feedback

760 scenario seq-variation-nudge
840 capture screen nudge_runtime_feedback

# Exercise one real sequencer binding so workflow verification records dispatch.
920 tap MACRO_8 60
